_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0306","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"子"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"十二年冬，楚平王卒。十三年春，吳欲因楚喪而伐之，使公子蓋餘、燭庸以兵圍楚之六、灊。使季札於晉，以觀諸侯之變。楚發兵絶吳兵後，吳兵不得還。於是吳公子光曰：「此時不可失也。」告專諸曰：「不索何獲！我眞王嗣，當立，吾欲求之。季子雖至，不吾廢也。」專諸曰：「王僚可殺也。母老子弱，而兩公子將兵攻楚，楚絶其路。方今吳外困於楚，而內空無骨鯁之臣，是無奈我何。」光曰：「我身，子之身也。」四月丙子，光伏甲士於窟室，而謁王僚飲。王僚使兵陳於道，自王宮至光之家，門階戶席，皆王僚之親也，人夾持鈹。公子光詳爲足疾，入於窟室，使專諸置匕首於炙魚之中以進食。手匕首刺王僚，鈹交於匈，遂弑王僚。公子光竟代立爲王，是爲吳王闔廬。闔廬乃以專諸子爲卿。","source_term":"子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji031-033","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"78u_8ii_bnr"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p001079"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","mention_count":6,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:m023-0060","c-shiji-031-wu:m023-0086","c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0086","c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0120","c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0253","c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0304"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:p023","c-shiji-031-wu:p024"],"passage_count":2},{"source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-066","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:m007-0152","c-shiji-066-wu:m008-0080"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:p007","c-shiji-066-wu:p008"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-031-wu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji031-033","subject_person_id":"78u_8ii_bnr_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"78u_8ii_b